WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.060
We all know Ghostbusters is the greatest movie of all time, but here's 18 facts about Ghostbusters you probably don't know.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.080
You never studied.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:14.160
According to legend a trailer was released with a real 1-800 number leading to a recorded message from Bill Murray and Dan Aykroyd. 

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.880
The number supposedly got a thousand calls per hour, twenty four hours a day for six weeks. 

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:24.780
Alternate casting choices included Eddy Murphy as Winston, Michael Keaton as Egon, and John Bellucci as Venkman. 

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:28.910
But after Bellucci's death Dan Aykroyd used him as the inspiration for Slimer. 

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:35.010
John candy was originally cast in the role of Lewis, and the role of Gozer was originally supposed to be played by Paul Reubens. 

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:41.500
In the original script the ghost busters were city workers like firemen. They wore blue jump suits, helmets with visors, and used magic wands.  

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.450
Most of the movie's best lines are improvised, including: 

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:46.810
You're more like a game show host.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:50.940
When someone asks you if you're a god, you say YES! 

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:54.480
Dogs and cats living together, mass hysteria 

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.840
No adhesive here, just good ole fashion salvia. 

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:01.360
The fire house exterior is in New York, while the interior is in LA.  

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.330
My uncle though he was Saint Jerome. 

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.080
Saint Jerome is the patron saint of librarians. 

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:09.030
These alternate takes revealed different original names for the movie. 

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:10.410
Ghost Stoppers

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:11.980
Ghost Blasters

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.950
This is what 50 gallons of shaving cream looks like. 

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:16.110
Cameo by porn star Ron Jeremey. 

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.490
Film debut of Larry King. 

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:23.390
This is a practical effect, Sigourney Weaver wore a full body cast and was strapped to a post hidden in the curtains. 

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:27.320
The term proton pack is never said until halfway through Ghost Busters 2. 

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.290
The voice of Zuul is director Ivan Reitman.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:33.420
There is no Dana, only Zuul. 

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:41.680
And finally the odds of winning the jackpot on the official ghostbusters slot machine are only slightly higher than the odds of bill Murray appearing in Ghost Busters 3. 

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:44.630
So be good, for goodness sake. 

